OL,3,GNEWSAMP facing voice loss after surgery
OL,4,Ashows recovery signs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe "whispering MP" who feared she may
OL,7,Fnever be able to speak confidently
OL,8,Fagain revealed she has seen signs of
OL,9,Frecovery after suffering nerve damage
OL,10,Fto her vocal cords during surgery.
OL,12,FLiberal Democrat Anna Sabine lost her
OL,13,Fvoice for several months following a
OL,14,Fthyroid operation in June, which cut
OL,15,Fone of the nerves to her vocal cords,
OL,16,Fleaving her with a condition called
OL,17,Fvocal cord paralysis.
OL,19,FThe MP for Frome and East Somerset said
OL,20,Fthe loss of her voice had made her want
OL,21,Fto "hide" when Parliament returned in
OL,22,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
