OL,3,GNEWSAMP facing voice loss after surgery
OL,4,Ashows recovery signs
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut in a surprise turn of events,
OL,7,FSabine said she awoke a few weeks ago
OL,8,Fto find it had regained some of its
OL,9,Fnatural strength and "broadly speaking,
OL,10,Fit's back to where it should be".
